        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_01",
      "hash64": "2F943421E23CA2E4",
      "text": "Boh, sono normali.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_01",
      "hash64": "ECC8A4A044460EC2",
      "text": "Non direi... Perfino io so che tuo padre è a capo\\ndell’azienda che produce gli Smart Rotom.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_02",
      "hash64": "2F943721E23CA7FD",
      "text": "Come fai a saperlo?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_02",
      "hash64": "ECC8A3A044460D0F",
      "text": "Beh, è famoso... Ho anche fatto qualche ricerca\\nsul suo conto, ma questo è un altro discorso.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_02",
      "hash64": "0B6F533EBE970151",
      "text": "Quindi sei una signorina di buona famiglia?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_03",
      "hash64": "2F943621E23CA64A",
      "text": "Aaargh! Non chiamarmi così, dai!\\nNon mi si addice proprio.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_04",
      "hash64": "2F943121E23C9DCB",
      "text": "Ma tornando alla tua domanda...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_05",
      "hash64": "2F943021E23C9C18",
      "text": "I miei stimati genitori non si curano molto di me,\\nma onestamente meglio così.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_06",
      "hash64": "2F943321E23CA131",
      "text": "Ho anche una sorella maggiore, quindi posso\\nfare più o meno quello che mi pare.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_03",
      "hash64": "0B6F523EBE96FF9E",
      "text": "Wow, hai detto \"stimati genitori\"?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_03",
      "hash64": "ECC8A2A044460B5C",
      "text": "A quanto pare la signorina ha ricevuto\\nun’educazione eccellente.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_07",
      "hash64": "2F943221E23C9F7E",
      "text": "Insomma, smettetela!! Piuttosto, Penny, perché\\nnon ci parli un po’ della tua, di famiglia?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_04",
      "hash64": "ECC8A1A0444609A9",
      "text": "Eh...? La mia...?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_05",
      "hash64": "ECC8A0A0444607F6",
      "text": "Il mio vecchio è un rompiscatole di prima\\ncategoria...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_08",
      "hash64": "2F942D21E23C96FF",
      "text": "Cioè? È iperprotettivo?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_06",
      "hash64": "ECC89FA044460643",
      "text": "Ha una voce assordante, mi sta sempre attaccato\\ne mi dà nomignoli strani tipo \"Penny cucciola\"![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_07",
      "hash64": "ECC89EA044460490",
      "text": "Insomma, è un vecchio rompiscatole!\\nNon vi serve sapere altro![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_04",
      "hash64": "0B6F553EBE9704B7",
      "text": "Wow... Quasi quasi mi dispiace un po’ per il papà\\ndella nostra Penny cucciola.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_08",
      "hash64": "ECC8ADA044461E0D",
      "text": "Dacci un taglio!![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
